                        "notes_en":  "Microtask 138 ufp_mac_init was locally attested with two identical canonical builds, assembly, KCFI, Ghidra/P-Code, strict Joern, and an ASAN/UBSAN harness. The harness proves layout initialization, call order, the conditional platform-device update, and retained NULL-workqueue behavior. The full driver and hardware validation remain incomplete.",
